  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the galangal and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the tom yum paste and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the coconut milk, light rum, lemon juice, and fish sauce, whisking constantly.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until pink, about 2-3 minutes per side.",
    "Add the lime leaves and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional lime leaves if desired."
